# 14 are byte-duplicates of h/CHANGES-2026-09-11-*.md and MICROSCOPE-*.md,
# 5 are SKILL.md drafts (boundscheck/verify-say/writing-forms identical to
# the garden copy; skilltank + sandboxer are the superseded pre-edit states
# already archived under skills/*/.arc/2026-09/, sha16 df75d29e17bd6b40 =
# SIGN-QUEUE row 30).  The 3 with no other home were copied into h/ first:
# SEALED-2026-09-09-hypothesis-vibrobeast-arm.md (sha256 verified against
# h/SEAL-2026-09-09-hypothesis-vibrobeast.sha256), PROMPT-2026-09-09-works-
# wave0-wave1.md, and RECIPE.org (as h/RECIPE-2026-09-11-pub.org).
# Nothing was deleted; the directory stays on disk, just untracked.
Claude outputs/

